# The sabotage engine here vendors tree_hold.py next to itself (card `ec8921ef`) and
# imports it, so a run leaves a __pycache__ directory. Untracked litter in a repo reads
# as somebody's work in progress, which this box's standing rule says not to throw away.
__pycache__/
